{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123574","id":4560003893,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABD8wjNQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123574","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123574.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123574.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123574","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123574/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123574/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123574/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c03b1f8d2c7f4492aef96d88168befb58b5b652f","number":123574,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[Android] Export project as an Android Archive (AAR)","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe Android export preset currently supports the ability to export a Godot project as an Android package ([APK](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Apk_(file_format))) or as an Android App Bundle ([AAB](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Android_App_Bundle)). \r\n\r\nThis PR adds the Android Archive ([AAR](https://developer.android.com/studio/projects/android-library)) as another export format, allowing a Godot project to be bundled within an Android archive so it can be exported and embedded within another Android project.\r\n\r\nTo do so, this PR updates the layout of the [`app` module](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/engine_details/development/configuring_an_ide/android_studio.html#building-debugging-the-app-module). The `app` module is an Android application module, meaning it has the ability to create `APK` and `AAB` binaries. \r\nAn Android application module can depend on an [Android library module](https://developer.android.com/studio/projects/android-library#CreateLibrary), allowing it to incorporate the library's functionality at build time. In addition, Android library modules can export `AAR` binaries, allowing other libraries or applications to depend on them via the generate `AAR` binary.\r\n\r\nThis PR introduces the `:app:dataLib` library module as a dependency of the `:app` module, and migrate most of the `:app` module (code, manifest, resources, assets) to it. The build flow for creating `APK` and `AAB` binaries is unchanged given the new dependency ensures the `:app` module generated binaries end up with the same content as with the previous module layout.\r\nHowever the migration of the `:app` module code to the `:app:dataLib` module means that now we can also generate `AAR` binaries with the same logic.\r\n\r\n**Note:** \r\n- When exporting a Godot project as an `AAR`, an additional `aar_deps` folder is created in the target export directory containing other `AAR` binaries provided by the project's plugins, as those cannot be merged directly with the generated project `AAR`. \r\n- The first commit update the Android gradle plugin to version `8.13.2` which is required for some of the new capabilities we're using. The bulk of the changes is in the second commit.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestone